WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.010
This query creates a long monthly product summary
Each row represents

00:00:06.036 --> 00:00:11.752
one product-month The time dimension category
dimension and measure

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:17.679
stay in separate columns This shape is flexible for
charting because new products

00:00:17.705 --> 00:00:20.363
become new rows instead of requiring new columns
